    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/capability",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Capability",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "القدرة",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Capacidad",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Capacité",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Возможность",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "能力",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "A high-level ability the health system possesses or needs in order to achieve its goals. It expresses what the health system is able to do, independently of how that ability is implemented.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "قدرة رفيعة المستوى يمتلكها النظام الصحي أو يحتاج إليها من أجل تحقيق أهدافه. وهي تعبّر عمّا يستطيع النظام الصحي القيام به، بصرف النظر عن كيفية تنفيذ تلك القدرة.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Aptitud de alto nivel que el sistema de salud posee o necesita para alcanzar sus objetivos. Expresa lo que el sistema de salud es capaz de hacer, con independencia de cómo se implemente dicha aptitud.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Aptitude de haut niveau que le système de santé possède ou dont il a besoin pour atteindre ses objectifs. Elle exprime ce que le système de santé est en mesure de faire, indépendamment de la manière dont cette aptitude est mise en œuvre.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Высокоуровневая способность, которой обладает система здравоохранения или которая необходима ей для достижения ее целей. Она выражает то, что система здравоохранения способна делать, независимо от того, как эта способность реализована.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "卫生系统为实现其目标所具备或所需的高层次能力。它表达卫生系统能够做什么，而与该能力如何实现无关。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/capability#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/capability#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/capability#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/capability#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/capability#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "The RA draft's own glossary wording, verbatim (folio/dpi-h-ra/glossary/t-glossary-lead-a31853.md). Wording alternative in RA Table 3.1 (library/who-dpi-h-reference-architecture-draft-v1/sections/sec-026-31-the-architecture-description-approach.md): \"An ability that an organisation, person, or system possesses — expressed in terms of what can be done, not how or by whom.\" Both are recorded as candidates; neither is chosen (smart-ra#133 S1).",
      "skos:example": [
        {
          "@value": "Medication prescribing and dispensing; clinical decision support.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "folio/dpi-h-ra/glossary/t-glossary-lead-a31853.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
