    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/foundational-digital-public-infrastructure",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Foundational Digital Public Infrastructure",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "البنية التحتية الرقمية العامة التأسيسية",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Infraestructura pública digital fundacional",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Infrastructure publique numérique fondamentale",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Базовая цифровая общественная инфраструктура",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "基础性数字公共基础设施",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "DPI-F",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Foundational Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI-F) is the digital public infrastructure, such as identity, payments and data exchange, upon which the health sector can build. DPI-H is distinct from DPI-F and builds on it.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "البنية التحتية الرقمية العامة التأسيسية (DPI-F) هي البنية التحتية الرقمية العامة، مثل الهوية والمدفوعات وتبادل البيانات، التي يمكن للقطاع الصحي البناء عليها. وتختلف DPI-H عن DPI-F وتُبنى عليها.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "La infraestructura pública digital fundacional (DPI-F) es la infraestructura pública digital, como la identidad, los pagos y el intercambio de datos, sobre la cual puede construir el sector de la salud. La DPI-H es distinta de la DPI-F y se basa en ella.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "L'infrastructure publique numérique fondamentale (DPI-F) est l'infrastructure publique numérique, telle que l'identité, les paiements et l'échange de données, sur laquelle le secteur de la santé peut s'appuyer. La DPI-H est distincte de la DPI-F et s'appuie sur elle.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Базовая цифровая общественная инфраструктура (DPI-F) — это цифровая общественная инфраструктура, например в области идентификации, платежей и обмена данными, на основе которой может строиться сектор здравоохранения. DPI-H отличается от DPI-F и строится на ее основе.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "基础性数字公共基础设施（DPI-F）是卫生部门可在其上构建的数字公共基础设施，例如身份、支付和数据交换。DPI-H有别于DPI-F，并以其为基础构建。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/foundational-digital-public-infrastructure#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/foundational-digital-public-infrastructure#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/foundational-digital-public-infrastructure#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/foundational-digital-public-infrastructure#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/foundational-digital-public-infrastructure#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "DPI-F",
      "skos:scopeNote": "Added to the RA glossary table in CS-001 (smart-ra#185, public comments No. 136 and No. 327), per committee feedback (CL). A candidate until the RA editors adopt it through the public review. Named in the RA draft's Acronyms table, which gives the expansion used as prefLabel, and in Section 1.2.3 on cross-sectoral foundational DPI (digital identity, payments, data exchange).",
      "dcterms:source": "folio/dpi-h-ra/glossary/t-glossary-lead-a31853.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/foundational-digital-public-infrastructure#label-ar",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "البنية التحتية الرقمية العامة التأسيسية",
        "@language": "ar"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
