    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/health-digital-public-infrastructure",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Health Digital Public Infrastructure",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "البنية التحتية الرقمية العامة للصحة",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Infraestructura pública digital para la salud",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Infrastructure publique numérique pour la santé",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Цифровая общественная инфраструктура здравоохранения",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "卫生数字公共基础设施",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "DPI-H",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "HDPI",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Health Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI-H) refers to digital resources that are built as a shared means for fulfilling multiple health agency functions.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "تشير البنية التحتية الرقمية العامة للصحة (DPI-H) إلى الموارد الرقمية التي تُبنى بوصفها وسيلة مشتركة لأداء وظائف متعددة للجهات الصحية.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "La infraestructura pública digital para la salud (DPI-H) se refiere a los recursos digitales construidos como medio compartido para cumplir múltiples funciones de los organismos de salud.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "L'infrastructure publique numérique pour la santé (DPI-H) désigne les ressources numériques construites comme moyen partagé de remplir de multiples fonctions des organismes de santé.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Цифровая общественная инфраструктура здравоохранения (DPI-H) означает цифровые ресурсы, созданные в качестве общего средства для выполнения множества функций органов здравоохранения.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "卫生数字公共基础设施（DPI-H）是指作为履行多项卫生机构职能的共享手段而构建的数字资源。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/health-digital-public-infrastructure#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/health-digital-public-infrastructure#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/health-digital-public-infrastructure#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/health-digital-public-infrastructure#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/health-digital-public-infrastructure#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "DPI-H",
      "skos:scopeNote": "The RA draft's own glossary wording, verbatim (folio/dpi-h-ra/glossary/t-glossary-lead-a31853.md). Wording alternative in RA §1.1.2 body (library/who-dpi-h-reference-architecture-draft-v1/sections/sec-002-112-understanding-digital-public-infrastructure.md), which adds a second defining sentence: \"Health Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI-H) refers to digital resources that are built as a shared means for fulfilling multiple health agency functions. These digital resources for health — encompassing both systems and specifications — leverage foundational DPI, are interoperable, reusable, publicly governed and built on open standards.\" Both are recorded as candidates; neither is chosen (smart-ra#133 S1).",
      "dcterms:source": "folio/dpi-h-ra/glossary/t-glossary-lead-a31853.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
    {
