          "@value": "SNOMED GPS",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "SNOMED-GPS",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Global Patient Set",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine-Global Patient Set",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "GPS",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Global Patient Set is a list of basic clinical terms. It is an open and freely accessible subset of SNOMED CT terms that represents the breadth of concepts included in the SNOMED CT International Edition.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Global Patient Set قائمة بالمصطلحات السريرية الأساسية. وهي مجموعة فرعية مفتوحة ومتاحة مجانًا من مصطلحات SNOMED CT تمثل نطاق المفاهيم المشمولة في الإصدار الدولي من SNOMED CT.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Global Patient Set es una lista de términos clínicos básicos. Es un subconjunto abierto y de libre acceso de términos de SNOMED CT que representa la amplitud de los conceptos incluidos en la edición internacional de SNOMED CT.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "La Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Global Patient Set est une liste de termes cliniques de base. Il s'agit d'un sous-ensemble ouvert et librement accessible de termes SNOMED CT qui représente l'étendue des concepts inclus dans l'édition internationale de SNOMED CT.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Global Patient Set — это перечень базовых клинических терминов. Это открытое и свободно доступное подмножество терминов SNOMED CT, отражающее широту понятий, включенных в SNOMED CT International Edition.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Global Patient Set是一份基本临床术语清单。它是SNOMED CT术语的开放、可免费获取的子集，代表SNOMED CT国际版所包含概念的广度。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/snomed-gps#label-ar"
