        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/snomed-gps#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "SNOMED-GPS",
      "skos:scopeNote": "The RA draft's own wording, verbatim. A candidate until the RA editors adopt it through the public review. Expanded in PHC handbook Abbreviations (who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-001-abbreviations.md, pp. 7-8) as \"SNOMED-GPS\" = \"Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine-Global Patient Set\" and cited in SFP handbook §4.4 (who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-025-44-outline-data-requirements.md, page-042.md, p. 30).",
