    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/digitalization",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Digitalization",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "الرقمنة",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Digitalización",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Digitalisation",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Цифровизация",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "数字化",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "digitalization",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "The process of digitally automating and simplifying processes to streamline individual health programmes and reduce manual efforts for greater efficiency (12,13).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "عملية الأتمتة الرقمية للعمليات وتبسيطها لتيسير البرامج الصحية الفردية والحد من الجهود اليدوية لتحقيق كفاءة أكبر (12,13).",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Proceso de automatizar y simplificar digitalmente los procesos para racionalizar los distintos programas de salud y reducir el trabajo manual a fin de lograr una mayor eficiencia (12,13).",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Processus consistant à automatiser et simplifier les processus par le numérique afin de rationaliser les différents programmes de santé et de réduire les tâches manuelles pour une plus grande efficience (12,13).",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Процесс цифровой автоматизации и упрощения процессов для оптимизации отдельных программ здравоохранения и сокращения ручного труда в целях повышения эффективности (12,13).",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "以数字方式自动化和简化流程，以精简各个卫生规划并减少人工工作、提高效率的过程 (12,13)。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/digitalization#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/digitalization#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/digitalization#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/digitalization#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/digitalization#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "PHC handbook glossary wording, verbatim (who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md, p. 8). Wording alternatives across the DTH corpus (smart-ra#133 S1): (1) SC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"In the health context, the process of digitally automating and simplifying processes to streamline individual health programmes and reduce manual efforts for greater efficiency. Digitalization is the second step in digital transformation (3, 6).\" (2) PC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8) and SFP handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/page-009.md, p. 9): \"The process of digitally automating and simplifying processes to streamline individual health programmes and reducing manual efforts for greater efficiency. Digitalization is the second step towards digital transformation.\" All are recorded as candidates; none is chosen.",
