    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Features",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "الخصائص",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Características",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Fonctionnalités",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Свойства",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "特性",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "features",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "The characteristics of a system that include look and feel as well as what the system can do (e.g. “reporting” can be a feature of a PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "سمات النظام التي تشمل الشكل والمظهر وكذلك ما يمكن للنظام القيام به (على سبيل المثال، يمكن أن يكون «الإبلاغ» خاصية من خصائص PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Rasgos de un sistema que incluyen su aspecto y su manejo, así como lo que el sistema puede hacer (por ejemplo, la «generación de informes» puede ser una característica de un PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Caractéristiques d'un système, qui comprennent son aspect et sa convivialité ainsi que ce que le système peut faire (par exemple, la « production de rapports » peut être une fonctionnalité d'un PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Характеристики системы, включающие как внешний вид и удобство использования, так и то, что система способна делать (например, «отчетность» может быть свойством PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "系统的特性，包括外观和感受以及系统能够做什么（例如，“报告”可以是PCPOSS的一项特性）。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "PHC handbook glossary wording, verbatim (who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md, p. 9). Wording alternatives across the DTH corpus, differing only in domain example and 'a system' vs 'your system' (smart-ra#133 S1): (1) SC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"The characteristics of a system that include look and feel as well as what the system can do (e.g., “order processing” can be a feature of an order management solution).\" (2) PC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8) and SFP handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/page-009.md, p. 9): \"The characteristics of your system that include look and feel as well as what the system can do (e.g., “approval workflow” can be a feature of a product master data management solution).\" All are recorded as candidates; none is chosen.",
      "skos:related": [
