    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Functional Requirements",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "المتطلبات الوظيفية",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Requisitos funcionales",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Exigences fonctionnelles",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Функциональные требования",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "功能需求",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "functional requirements",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Functional requirements",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Description of what the digital system needs to do to support the tasks that make up the health system process and address the identified health system challenges (e.g. a PCPOSS must be able to remind health workers which health service users to follow-up with).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "وصف لما يحتاج النظام الرقمي إلى القيام به لدعم المهام التي تتألف منها عملية النظام الصحي ومعالجة تحديات النظام الصحي المحددة (على سبيل المثال، يجب أن يكون PCPOSS قادرًا على تذكير العاملين الصحيين بمستخدمي الخدمات الصحية المطلوب متابعتهم).",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Descripción de lo que el sistema digital tiene que hacer para apoyar las tareas que componen el proceso del sistema de salud y abordar los desafíos del sistema de salud identificados (por ejemplo, un PCPOSS debe ser capaz de recordar a los trabajadores de salud a qué usuarios de los servicios de salud tienen que hacer seguimiento).",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Description de ce que le système numérique doit faire pour appuyer les tâches qui composent le processus du système de santé et répondre aux problèmes recensés du système de santé (par exemple, un PCPOSS doit être en mesure de rappeler aux agents de santé les usagers des services de santé dont ils doivent assurer le suivi).",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Описание того, что должна делать цифровая система для поддержки задач, составляющих процесс системы здравоохранения, и решения выявленных проблем системы здравоохранения (например, PCPOSS должна быть способна напоминать медицинским работникам о том, в отношении каких пользователей услуг здравоохранения необходимо провести последующее наблюдение).",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "对数字系统需要做什么的描述，以支持构成卫生系统流程的任务，并应对已识别的卫生系统挑战（例如，PCPOSS必须能够提醒卫生工作者需要对哪些卫生服务使用者进行随访）。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "PHC handbook glossary wording, verbatim (who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md, p. 9). Wording and substantive alternatives across the DTH corpus (smart-ra#133 S1): (1) SC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"A description of what the digital system needs to do to support the tasks that make up the business process and address the identified challenges.\" (2) PC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"Description of what the digital system needs to do to support the tasks that make up the health system process and address the identified challenges (e.g., a product master data management solution must be able to define categories and attributes to organize product information).\" (3) SFP handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/page-009.md, p. 9): \"Capabilities the system must have to meet the end users’ needs and achieve tasks within the business process.\" All four are recorded as candidates; none is chosen.",
      "skos:related": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functions"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements#label-ar",
