    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functions",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Functions",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "الوظائف",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Funciones",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Fonctions",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Функции",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "功能",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "functions",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Functions in a system are how features are implemented (e.g. “calculating aggregate data” and “displaying feedback in the form of diagrams” are functions of the “reporting” feature of a PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "الوظائف في النظام هي الطريقة التي تُنفَّذ بها الخصائص (على سبيل المثال، «حساب البيانات المجمّعة» و«عرض التغذية الراجعة في شكل مخططات» وظيفتان من وظائف خاصية «الإبلاغ» في PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Las funciones de un sistema son la forma en que se implementan las características (por ejemplo, «calcular datos agregados» y «mostrar retroalimentación en forma de diagramas» son funciones de la característica de «generación de informes» de un PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Dans un système, les fonctions sont la manière dont les fonctionnalités sont mises en œuvre (par exemple, le « calcul de données agrégées » et l'« affichage d'un retour d'information sous forme de diagrammes » sont des fonctions de la fonctionnalité « production de rapports » d'un PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Функции системы — это то, как реализуются ее свойства (например, «расчет агрегированных данных» и «отображение обратной связи в виде диаграмм» являются функциями свойства «отчетность» PCPOSS).",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "系统中的功能是特性的实现方式（例如，“计算汇总数据”和“以图表形式显示反馈”是PCPOSS“报告”特性的功能）。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functions#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functions#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functions#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functions#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functions#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "PHC handbook glossary wording, verbatim (who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md, p. 9). Substantive alternative in SC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"Business processes within a system that help the system perform (e.g., “receiving inventory” and “picking inventory” are functions of the “warehousing” feature of a warehouse management system).\" (PHC defines functions as \"how features are implemented\"; SC defines them as \"Business processes within a system that help the system perform\".) Both are recorded as candidates; neither is chosen (smart-ra#133 S1).",
      "skos:related": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/features"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
