    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Non-Functional Requirements",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "المتطلبات غير الوظيفية",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Requisitos no funcionales",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Exigences non fonctionnelles",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Нефункциональные требования",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "非功能需求",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Non-functional requirements",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "nonfunctional requirements",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "NFR",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "General attributes and features of the digital system to ensure usability and overcome technical and physical constraints. Examples of non-functional requirements include ability to work offline, multiple language settings, and password protection (see section 3.8).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "سمات وخصائص عامة للنظام الرقمي لضمان سهولة الاستخدام والتغلب على القيود التقنية والمادية. ومن أمثلة المتطلبات غير الوظيفية القدرة على العمل دون اتصال بالإنترنت، وإعدادات اللغات المتعددة، والحماية بكلمة مرور (انظر القسم 3.8).",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Atributos y características generales del sistema digital para garantizar la facilidad de uso y superar las limitaciones técnicas y físicas. Algunos ejemplos de requisitos no funcionales son la capacidad de funcionar sin conexión, la configuración en varios idiomas y la protección mediante contraseña (véase la sección 3.8).",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Attributs et caractéristiques généraux du système numérique visant à garantir son utilisabilité et à surmonter les contraintes techniques et physiques. Parmi les exemples d'exigences non fonctionnelles figurent la capacité de fonctionner hors ligne, les paramètres multilingues et la protection par mot de passe (voir la section 3.8).",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Общие атрибуты и свойства цифровой системы, призванные обеспечить удобство использования и преодоление технических и физических ограничений. Примеры нефункциональных требований включают возможность работы в автономном режиме, поддержку нескольких языков и защиту паролем (см. раздел 3.8).",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "数字系统为确保可用性并克服技术和物理限制所具有的一般属性和特性。非功能需求的例子包括离线工作能力、多语言设置和密码保护（见第3.8节）。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "NFR",
      "skos:scopeNote": "PHC handbook glossary wording, verbatim (who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md, p. 10), identical (without section cross-reference) in SFP handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/page-010.md, p. 10). Substantive alternatives across the DTH corpus (smart-ra#133 S1): (1) SC handbook glossary ('nonfunctional requirements', who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"A description of how the digital system needs to operate and perform in order to support the tasks that make up the business process.\" (2) PC handbook glossary ('Non-functional requirements', who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-008.md, p. 8): \"Description of the attributes and constraints that the system must have to ensure its quality and performance. These requirements do not specify what the system should do, but rather how the system should perform its functions. (e.g., a product master data management solution must be able to support offline mode when network connectivity is not available)\" All are recorded as candidates; none is chosen.",
      "skos:related": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/functional-requirements"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "who-iris/library/9789240093362-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-ar",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "المتطلبات غير الوظيفية",
        "@language": "ar"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-es",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "Requisitos no funcionales",
        "@language": "es"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/non-functional-requirements#label-fr",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "Exigences non fonctionnelles",
