    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/open-technologies",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Open Technologies",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "التكنولوجيات المفتوحة",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Tecnologías abiertas",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Technologies ouvertes",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Открытые технологии",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "开放技术",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "open technologies",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Open technologies denote components of configurable and extensible source code — often curated as digital public goods — that perform distinct functions while adhering to open standards.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "تدل التكنولوجيات المفتوحة على مكونات من شفرة مصدرية قابلة للتهيئة والتوسيع — كثيرًا ما تُنظَّم بوصفها منافع عامة رقمية — تؤدي وظائف متمايزة مع الالتزام بالمعايير المفتوحة.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Las tecnologías abiertas designan componentes de código fuente configurable y ampliable —a menudo gestionados como bienes públicos digitales— que realizan funciones diferenciadas ajustándose a estándares abiertos.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Les technologies ouvertes désignent des composants de code source configurable et extensible — souvent organisés en tant que biens publics numériques — qui remplissent des fonctions distinctes tout en respectant des normes ouvertes.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Открытые технологии означают компоненты конфигурируемого и расширяемого исходного кода — часто курируемые в качестве цифровых общественных благ, — которые выполняют отдельные функции, соблюдая открытые стандарты.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "开放技术是指可配置、可扩展的源代码组件——通常作为数字公共产品加以管理——在遵循开放标准的同时执行不同的功能。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/open-technologies#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/open-technologies#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/open-technologies#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/open-technologies#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/open-technologies#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "RA §2.2.2 body wording, verbatim (library/who-dpi-h-reference-architecture-draft-v1/sections/sec-022-222-the-enabling-conditions-for-reddhi.md, p. 35–39), citing Mehl et al. 2023 (library/mehl-2023-full-stac-oqad018/, glossary/full-stac.glossary.json: \"Components of configurable and extensible source code, often curated as 'global goods' or 'digital public goods', that perform a distinct function while adhering to open standards.\"). Linked via exactMatch to the full-STAC scheme (smart-ra#133 S1, smart-ra#143).",
