    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Traceability",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "إمكانية التتبع",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Trazabilidad",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Traçabilité",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Прослеживаемость",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "可追溯性",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "traceability",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "The ability to trace something. In some cases, it is interpreted as the ability to verify the history, location or application of an item by means of documented identification (14).",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "القدرة على تتبع شيء ما. وفي بعض الحالات، تُفسَّر بأنها القدرة على التحقق من تاريخ صنف ما أو موقعه أو استخدامه عن طريق تعريف موثق (14).",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Capacidad de rastrear algo. En algunos casos, se interpreta como la capacidad de verificar el historial, la ubicación o la aplicación de un artículo mediante una identificación documentada (14).",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Capacité de retracer quelque chose. Dans certains cas, elle s'entend comme la capacité de vérifier l'historique, l'emplacement ou l'utilisation d'un article au moyen d'une identification documentée (14).",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Возможность что-либо отследить. В некоторых случаях это толкуется как возможность проверить историю, местонахождение или применение объекта посредством задокументированной идентификации (14).",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "追溯某事物的能力。在某些情况下，它被解释为通过有文件记录的标识来核实某一物品的历史、位置或应用的能力 (14)。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "SC handbook glossary wording, verbatim (who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-009.md, p. 9, citing the WHO policy paper on traceability of medical products, ref. 14). Internal/substantive alternative in SC handbook Ch. 4 boxed definition (who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-054.md, p. 54, citing GS1): \"Traceability is the ability to trace the history, application or location of an object. In a supply chain context, it is the ability to see the movement of health products across the supply chain.\" Shared across dth-sc, dth-pc, and dth-sfp; both definitions are recorded as candidates and neither is chosen (smart-ra#133 S1, smart-ra#140).",
      "dcterms:source": "who-iris/library/9789240101197-eng/sections/page-009.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-ar",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "إمكانية التتبع",
        "@language": "ar"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-es",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "Trazabilidad",
        "@language": "es"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-fr",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "Traçabilité",
        "@language": "fr"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-ru",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "Прослеживаемость",
        "@language": "ru"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/traceability#label-zh",
      "@type": "skosxl:Label",
      "skosxl:literalForm": {
        "@value": "可追溯性",
        "@language": "zh"
      },
      "fa:translationStatus": "unofficial"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/trade-item",
      "@type": "skos:Concept",
      "skos:inScheme": {
        "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra"
      },
      "skos:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "Trade Item",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "الصنف التجاري",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Artículo comercial",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Article commercial",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Торговая единица",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "贸易项目",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:altLabel": [
        {
          "@value": "trade item",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Trade item",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "Trade items are manufacturer-specific branded health products that are identifiable and unique to a particular brand or manufacturer.",
          "@language": "en"
        },
        {
          "@value": "الأصناف التجارية هي منتجات صحية ذات علامة تجارية خاصة بالجهة المصنّعة، يمكن تحديدها وتكون فريدة لعلامة تجارية أو جهة مصنّعة بعينها.",
          "@language": "ar"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Los artículos comerciales son productos de salud de marca específicos de un fabricante, identificables y exclusivos de una marca o un fabricante determinados.",
          "@language": "es"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Les articles commerciaux sont des produits de santé de marque propres à un fabricant, identifiables et spécifiques à une marque ou à un fabricant donnés.",
          "@language": "fr"
        },
        {
          "@value": "Торговые единицы — это специфичная для производителя фирменная продукция медицинского назначения, которая идентифицируема и уникальна для конкретного бренда или производителя.",
          "@language": "ru"
        },
        {
          "@value": "贸易项目是制造商特定的品牌卫生产品，可识别且为特定品牌或制造商所独有。",
          "@language": "zh"
        }
      ],
      "skosxl:prefLabel": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/trade-item#label-ar"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/trade-item#label-es"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/trade-item#label-fr"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/trade-item#label-ru"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/trade-item#label-zh"
        }
      ],
      "skos:scopeNote": "Owner decision 2026-10-31 (smart-ra#142 item 1, smart-ra#139): Trade Item is the shared WHO concept with this narrow definition from the Product Catalogue handbook Ch. 2 body (who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-028.md, p. 28). The GS1 trade item is a separate external concept and the WHO term's broadMatch (every WHO Trade Item is a GS1 trade item, not the reverse: GS1's also covers services). The PC handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-009.md, p. 9) and SFP handbook glossary (who-iris/library/9789240120747-eng/sections/sec-002-glossary.md, page-011.md, p. 11) print the GS1 wording — \"Products or services that are priced, ordered or invoiced at any point in the supply chain\" — citing GS1 (PC ref. 13, SFP ref. 19); that sentence is recorded here as a note citing GS1, not as the WHO concept's definition.",
      "skos:related": [
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/generic-product"
        },
        {
          "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/product-master-data"
        }
      ],
      "skos:broadMatch": [
        {
          "@id": "https://www.gs1.org/standards/id-keys/gtin"
        }
      ],
      "dcterms:source": "who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-028.md",
      "skos:note": "candidate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns/glossary/dpi-h-ra/trade-item#label-ar",
