      ],
      "skos:notation": "EHR",
      "skos:scopeNote": "Expanded in Appendix C (Lifelong Health Record, Terminology and Scope), which contrasts Electronic Medical Record (EMR), Electronic Health Record (EHR), and Shared Health Record (SHR) with the Lifelong Health Record (LHR). Also used across the Digital Transformation Handbooks. A candidate: no standalone glossary definition has been adopted.",
      "dcterms:source": "folio/dpi-h-ra/appendix/p-c-metadata-registries-and-foundati-lifelong-health-record-2b7c0c.md",
